  "plan_source": "task 041",
  "sheet_prompt": "One illustration of 4 separate characters arranged in 2 rows of 2, evenly spaced across a single seamless background.\nSubject: a dog transformed into a banana: ONE single character, its whole body is one curved yellow banana (soft banana-yellow with a few brown freckles, the stem on top, a dark tip at the bottom, the peel as its skin), with the dog's face, expression and personality on it; it is not a dog standing next to a banana, not a dog holding or wearing a banana, and not a dog with a banana pattern; small cartoon arms and legs are allowed so it can act; identical in every cell.\nStyle: 16-bit pixel art character, crisp square pixels, limited colour palette, clean dark outline, retro game sprite look.\nOutline: none. Draw every character directly on the background with no outline, border, stroke, die-cut edge or halo around it.\nReading left to right, top to bottom, every character is a different moment: a wide range of emotions AND different states of action (standing, walking, running, jumping, sitting, lying down, leaning, reaching, spinning), so no two characters share a pose, a body position or a silhouette:\nCharacter 1: dancing joyfully, the curved banana body swaying, peel flaps swinging like arms, eyes closed, big smile\nCharacter 2: shocked, the peel flaps slipping down in surprise, eyes huge, mouth wide open\nCharacter 3: squashed flat like a cartoon, the banana body mushed wide with soft banana squeezing out at the ends, dazed face, stars circling\nCharacter 4: waving hello with a big happy grin\nMake every expression big and readable at small size: exaggerated eyes, eyebrows, mouth and body language.\nConsistency: the same character design, proportions and colours for all 4 characters.\nBackground: a single, seamless, solid pure green (#00FF00) background covering the whole image in exactly one shade, with no tiled panels, no shading variations, no tint, gradient, vignette or glow, no shadows, no floor, no noise.\nSpacing: every character is full body with a generous empty margin on every side (at least 20% of its own size), clearly separated from the others, none touching or crossing another.",
  "video_prompt": "Animate this illustration sheet as a 3-second clip. Every character performs its own big, highly expressive, cartoon-style animation in place, inside its own cell, showing a wide range of emotions:\n1. the banana body sways and curves to a beat, the peel flaps swing, a little hop and a spin\n2. the peel flaps slip down with a jolt, the eyes pop wide, the whole banana trembles\n3. squashes flat then springs back to its curved shape, dazed, stars orbit\n4. waves the raised hand in wide arcs while bouncing on tiptoes\nAnimation style: wide emotions, highly expressive faces and bodies, exaggerated squash and stretch, anticipation and follow-through, clear facial animation (eyes, eyebrows, mouth), secondary motion on ears, tails and props, each character on its own rhythm, lively and full of personality. Never a static pose and never only a gentle sway.\nKeep every character inside its own slot of the 2x2 layout; nothing may touch or cross a slot edge, and characters never interact with one another.\nEmpty slots stay empty: do not add any character, object or effect to them.\nStatic camera, no zoom, no pan, no cuts. Keep the one flat pure green (#00FF00) background exactly as it is, the same shade everywhere: no shadows, no gradient, no noise, no glow.\nKeep each character's design, proportions and colours unchanged and do not add outlines or borders.",
